  "_doc": "#1553 TABLE 2 — Cloud-scope APP → FOLDER allocation for Configs ▸ Launcher ▸ Folders. EVERY cloud (constellation-fleet) app of kind 'app' is explicitly allocated to a folder declared in launcher-folders/cloud.json. Served by the fleet-data client (Cloud Store provider, tier 3), read at runtime, NEVER baked into an APK. Each row: package, folder, order (position within the folder). 'others' is reserved for truly uncategorised / newly-installed apps at runtime and is never used here. Coverage is guarded by FolderCoverageTest: a cloud-* app with no row here fails the build. The launcher SuperApp itself (com.diegonmarcos.superapp) is the host of the grid and is allocated to System for completeness.",
